# Upstream (release/1.5) files that dev/1.5 is allowed to modify, one path per
# line with its reason. Everything else outside the release zone
# (backends/vulkan/runtime/graph/ops/{glsl,impl}/sarc/) and the dev zone must be
# byte-identical to release/1.5; sarc/tools/check.sh enforces this.
# Keep each hook a few lines; put logic in the release zone.
#
# kind: hook      = SARC entry point into an upstream code path
#       fix       = correction of upstream behaviour, active in release builds
#       backport  = cherry-picked upstream commit (name it) absent from release/1.5
# Hooks are shipped verbatim (make-release.sh drops only the dev zone), so an
# environment variable read in a hook is read in release builds too.
#
# Dev-zone entry points inside the release zone (null in a release; owner
# decision 2026-10-05, D4). Listed here for completeness; check.sh needs no entry:
#   impl/sarc/Select.h  Override::softmax_variant            read in SdpaCoopmat.cpp sdpa_softmax_shader_name (D4.1)
#   impl/sarc/Select.h  Override::sdpa_fused_{add,serves}    read in SdpaCoopmat.cpp sdpa_fused_skip / add_sdpa_fused
#                       (D4.3, owner review before promotion); written only by impl/sarc_dev/Overrides.cpp
#                       (RegistrarFusedNode, through impl/sarc_dev/FusedSlot.h)

